IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc27-length`
IMPORT `ccc27-s742-conditional-sentence`

-- ccc27-tests-s742.l4 -- tests for ccc27-length and sections 742 to 742.31. Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion.

§ `Tests -- the length helper`

-- The helper compares a length of time with a number of whole years. "Two years less a day" is below two years.
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` (`Length of time` OF 3, 0, 0, FALSE) 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` `two years` 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- exactly two years
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` `two years less a day` 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- one day short
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` (`Length of time` OF 1, 11, 0, FALSE) 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- 23 months
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` (`Length of time` OF 1, 11, 29, FALSE) 2 EQUALS NOTHING   -- 29 days might carry into a month: the text does not say how many days make a month
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` (`Length of time` OF 1, 6, 10, FALSE) 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- ten days cannot make up six months
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` (`Length of time` OF 2, 1, 0, TRUE) 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- two years and a month less a day is over two years
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` `ten years` 10 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the length of time is at least that many years` `five years` 10 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the sentence of imprisonment is at least that many years` `imprisonment for life` 10 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the sentence of imprisonment is at least that many years` `no imprisonment is stated` 10 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the sentence of imprisonment is at least that many years` (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`) 10 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the sentence of imprisonment is at least that many years` (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`) 10 EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Tests -- section 742`

#ASSERT `s 742 change, in relation to optional conditions` `s 742 a deletion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "includes deletions and additions"
#ASSERT `s 742 change, in relation to optional conditions` `s 742 an addition` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742 change, in relation to optional conditions` `s 742 an alteration that is neither a deletion nor an addition` EQUALS NOTHING   -- "includes" is not a closed list
#ASSERT `s 742 optional conditions` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742 optional conditions` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "means the conditions referred to in subsection 742.3(2)"
#ASSERT `s 742 supervisor` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742 supervisor` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- designated by someone who is not the Attorney General
#ASSERT `s 742 supervisor` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 2 does not decide who the Attorney General is on these facts
#ASSERT `s 742 supervisor` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "means a person designated"

§ `Tests -- section 742.1`

-- Building blocks for the facts of a sentence.
`s 742.1 test offence theft` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 334, ""
`s 742.1 test offence 239(1)` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 239, "(1)"
`s 742.1 test offence 269.1` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, ""
`s 742.1 test offence 272` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 272, ""
`s 742.1 test offence 273` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 273, ""
`s 742.1 test offence 318` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 318, ""
`s 742.1 test offence 153.1` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 153.1, ""
`s 742.1 test offence 271` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF 271, ""
`s 742.1 test sentence one year` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 1, 0, 0, FALSE)
`s 742.1 test sentence two years` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years`
`s 742.1 test sentence two years less a day` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`
`s 742.1 test sentence 23 months and 29 days` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 1, 11, 29, FALSE)
`s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`s 742.1 test punishment, life, no minimum, by indictment` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`s 742.1 test punishment, no maximum stated, by indictment` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, minimum one year, by indictment` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 1, 0, 0, FALSE)), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, minimum life, by indictment` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `imprisonment for life`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`

-- The facts, in the order of the record: convicted; the sentence imposed; community safety; consistent with ss 718 to 718.2; the punishment for the offence as prosecuted;
-- the offence; sentence imposed under 239(1)(b); the mode in which the offence is prosecuted; sexual; victim under 18; s 2 terrorism offence; s 2 criminal organization offence.
GIVEN convicted IS A BOOLEAN, sentence IS AN Imprisonment, safe IS A BOOLEAN, consistent IS A BOOLEAN, punishment IS A Punishment, offence IS A `Provision of the Code`,
      `under 239(1)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN, mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`, sexual IS A BOOLEAN, `under 18` IS A BOOLEAN, terror IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, org IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 742.1 facts of the sentence`
`s 742.1 test facts` MEANS `s 742.1 facts of the sentence` OF convicted, sentence, safe, consistent, punishment, offence, `under 239(1)(b)`, mode, sexual, `under 18`, terror, org

-- "of less than two years"
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence two years less a day` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- two years less a day is less than two years
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence two years` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- two years is not less than two years
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `imprisonment for life` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, life, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence 23 months and 29 days` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- the days might carry into a month
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `no imprisonment is stated` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- no sentence is stated
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court imposes a sentence of imprisonment of less than two years` (`s 742.1 test facts` FALSE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "If a person is convicted of an offence"

-- (a)
#ASSERT `s 742.1(a) the court is satisfied that service of the sentence in the community would not endanger the safety of the community and would be consistent with sections 718 to 718.2` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(a) the court is satisfied that service of the sentence in the community would not endanger the safety of the community and would be consistent with sections 718 to 718.2` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` FALSE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the community would be endangered
#ASSERT `s 742.1(a) the court is satisfied that service of the sentence in the community would not endanger the safety of the community and would be consistent with sections 718 to 718.2` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE FALSE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not consistent with sections 718 to 718.2

-- (b): not punishable by a minimum term of imprisonment
#ASSERT `s 742.1(b) the offence is not an offence punishable by a minimum term of imprisonment` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(b) the offence is not an offence punishable by a minimum term of imprisonment` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, minimum one year, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(b) the offence is not an offence punishable by a minimum term of imprisonment` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, minimum life, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a minimum of life is a minimum

-- (c): sections 239 (para 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273, 318
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 239(1)` TRUE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- 239 under paragraph 239(1)(b) (attempt to commit murder)
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 239(1)` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 239 but not under paragraph 239(1)(b)
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 269.1` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- torture
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 272` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 273` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c) the offence is not an offence under any of sections 239 (for which a sentence is imposed under paragraph 239(1)(b)), 269.1, 272, 273 or 318` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 318` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- advocating genocide

-- (c.1): by indictment, sections 153.1 and 271
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.1) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, under section 153.1 or 271` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 153.1` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.1) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, under section 153.1 or 271` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 271` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.1) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, under section 153.1 or 271` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 271` FALSE `on summary conviction` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- prosecuted summarily: paragraph (c.1) names only the indictable prosecution
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.1) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, under section 153.1 or 271` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- (c.2): by indictment, sexual nature or purpose, victim under 18
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.2) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, of a sexual nature, or committed for a sexual purpose, that involves a victim under 18 years of age` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.2) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, of a sexual nature, or committed for a sexual purpose, that involves a victim under 18 years of age` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` TRUE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the victim is 18 or over
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.2) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, of a sexual nature, or committed for a sexual purpose, that involves a victim under 18 years of age` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- not of a sexual nature
#ASSERT `s 742.1(c.2) the offence is not an offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, of a sexual nature, or committed for a sexual purpose, that involves a victim under 18 years of age` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `on summary conviction` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- prosecuted summarily

-- (d): terrorism or criminal organization offence, by indictment, maximum 10 years or more
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a terrorism offence with a 10-year maximum
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, life, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a criminal organization offence with a life maximum
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a terrorism offence, but the maximum is 5 years
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- neither kind of offence
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 2 does not say whether it is a terrorism offence, and the maximum is 10 years
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- whatever the offence is, a 5-year maximum is below 10 years
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, no maximum stated, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- a terrorism offence, but no maximum is stated
#ASSERT `s 742.1(d) the offence is not a terrorism offence, or a criminal organization offence, prosecuted by way of indictment, for which the maximum term of imprisonment is 10 years or more` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `on summary conviction` FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- prosecuted summarily: the paragraph speaks only of an indictable prosecution

-- The whole of section 742.1: "may ... if (a) to (d)"
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence two years` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- two years: not less than two years (F-2: the other reading is JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` FALSE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (a) fails
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, minimum one year, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (b) fails
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 318` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (c) fails
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence 271` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (c.1) fails
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (c.2) fails
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (d) fails
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `no imprisonment is stated` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 5 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- no sentence stated
#ASSERT `s 742.1 the court may order that the offender serve the sentence in the community` (`s 742.1 test facts` TRUE `s 742.1 test sentence one year` TRUE TRUE `s 742.1 test punishment, 10 years, no minimum, by indictment` `s 742.1 test offence theft` FALSE `by indictment` FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 2 does not say whether it is a terrorism offence: (d) is itself NOTHING

§ `Tests -- section 742.2`

#ASSERT `s 742.2(1) the court shall consider whether section 109 or 110 is applicable` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.2(1) the court shall consider whether section 109 or 110 is applicable` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "Before imposing a conditional sentence"
#ASSERT `s 742.2(2) a condition under paragraph 742.3(2)(b) affects the operation of section 109 or 110` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "does not affect"
#ASSERT `s 742.2(2) a condition under paragraph 742.3(2)(b) affects the operation of section 109 or 110` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Tests -- section 742.3`

-- (1): compulsory conditions
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1)(a) keep the peace and be of good behaviour` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1)(b) appear before the court when required to do so by the court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) report to a supervisor within two working days, or such longer period as the court directs, after the making of the conditional sentence order` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1)(c)(ii) report to a supervisor thereafter, when required by the supervisor and in the manner directed by the supervisor` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1)(d) remain within the jurisdiction of the court unless written permission to go outside that jurisdiction is obtained from the court or the supervisor` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1)(e) notify the court or the supervisor in advance of any change of name or address, and promptly notify the court or the supervisor of any change of employment or occupation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1) the court shall prescribe the condition as a condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(1) a condition of another kind` EQUALS NOTHING   -- the list is of what the court "shall" prescribe: other conditions are not covered
-- (c)(i): two working days, or such longer period as the court directs
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender reported to a supervisor in time` 2 NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender reported to a supervisor in time` 3 NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the third working day
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender reported to a supervisor in time` 4 (JUST 5) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the court directed a longer period of five working days
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender reported to a supervisor in time` 6 (JUST 5) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender reported to a supervisor in time` 2 (JUST 1) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a "longer" period cannot be shorter than two days
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender reported to a supervisor in time` 3 (JUST 1) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c)(i) as a regulative rule: reporting on the second working day and on the third
#TRACE `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender must report to a supervisor` 2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the offender` DOES `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) report to a supervisor` AT 2
#TRACE `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) the offender must report to a supervisor` 2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the offender` DOES `s 742.3(1)(c)(i) report to a supervisor` AT 3
-- (d)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(d) the offender has complied with the condition to remain within the jurisdiction of the court` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- within the jurisdiction
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(d) the offender has complied with the condition to remain within the jurisdiction of the court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- outside it, with written permission
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(d) the offender has complied with the condition to remain within the jurisdiction of the court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- outside it, without permission
-- (e)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of name` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- in advance
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of name` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- name and address: in advance, not merely promptly
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of address` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of address` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of employment` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- employment and occupation: promptly
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of employment` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of occupation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(1)(e) the offender has complied with the condition to notify of the change` `s 742.3(1)(e) a change of occupation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- advance notice alone is not "prompt" notice of the change (the text asks for it)

-- (2): optional conditions
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(a) abstain from the consumption of drugs except in accordance with a medical prescription, of alcohol or of any other intoxicating substance` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(a.1) provide a sample of a bodily substance on demand` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(a.2) provide a sample of a bodily substance at regular intervals` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(a.3) abstain from communicating with a person identified in the order or from going to a place or geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(b) abstain from owning, possessing or carrying a weapon` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(c) provide for the support or care of dependants` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(d) perform community service` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(e) attend a treatment program approved by the province` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2)(f) comply with such other reasonable conditions as the court considers desirable` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2) the court may prescribe the condition as an additional condition of a conditional sentence order` `s 742.3(2) a condition of another kind` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (a.1): the demand
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a peace officer, with grounds to suspect
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the supervisor
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- someone designated under subsection (7)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not a peace officer, nor the supervisor, nor designated
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` NOTHING FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 2 does not say whether the person is a peace officer
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no reasonable grounds to suspect a breach
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.1) the demand for a sample is within the condition` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the supervisor, but no reasonable grounds
-- (a.2)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.2) the requirement to provide samples at regular intervals is within the condition` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.2) the requirement to provide samples at regular intervals is within the condition` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no condition to abstain
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(a.2) the requirement to provide samples at regular intervals is within the condition` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the intervals are not specified by the supervisor in a Form 51 notice
-- (d): up to 240 hours over a period not exceeding eighteen months
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(d) the court may prescribe the community service` 240 18 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(d) the court may prescribe the community service` 100 6 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(d) the court may prescribe the community service` 241 18 EQUALS NOTHING   -- one hour over
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(d) the court may prescribe the community service` 240 19 EQUALS NOTHING   -- one month over
-- (f)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(f) the court may prescribe the other condition` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(f) the court may prescribe the other condition` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not reasonable (F-2: the other reading is JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(f) the court may prescribe the other condition` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the court does not consider it desirable
#ASSERT `s 742.3(2)(f) the court may prescribe the other condition` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- a regulation under 738(2) precludes it: the regulations are outside the sources

-- (3): the court's obligations
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the victim did not ask for a copy
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the victim asked and was not given a copy
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no copy to the offender
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no explanation of subsection (1) and sections 742.4 and 742.6
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no explanation of the procedure under section 742.4
#ASSERT `s 742.3(3) the court has met its obligations on making the order` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no reasonable measures to ensure understanding
-- (4)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(4) a failure to comply with subsection (3) affects the validity of the order` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "does not affect the validity"
#ASSERT `s 742.3(4) a failure to comply with subsection (3) affects the validity of the order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(5) the notice and the schedule of samples meet the limits of subsection (5)` TRUE 24 TRUE 7 EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- exactly at the limits
#ASSERT `s 742.3(5) the notice and the schedule of samples meet the limits of subsection (5)` TRUE 23 TRUE 7 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- first sample before 24 hours
#ASSERT `s 742.3(5) the notice and the schedule of samples meet the limits of subsection (5)` TRUE 24 TRUE 6 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- an interval under seven days
#ASSERT `s 742.3(5) the notice and the schedule of samples meet the limits of subsection (5)` TRUE 24 FALSE 7 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the intervals are not regular
#ASSERT `s 742.3(5) the notice and the schedule of samples meet the limits of subsection (5)` FALSE 24 TRUE 7 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the notice does not specify places, times and days
-- (8)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(8) the taking, analysis, storage, handling or destruction of the sample, or the protection or destruction of the record, is within the designations and specifications` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(8) the taking, analysis, storage, handling or destruction of the sample, or the protection or destruction of the record, is within the designations and specifications` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "may not ... except in accordance with"
-- (9)
#ASSERT `s 742.3(9) the Attorney General or minister of justice shall cause the samples to be destroyed within the periods prescribed by regulation` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.3(9) the Attorney General or minister of justice shall cause the samples to be destroyed within the periods prescribed by regulation` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "unless the samples are reasonably expected to be used as evidence"

§ `Tests -- section 742.31`

#ASSERT `s 742.31(1) the use of a bodily substance provided under a conditional sentence order is barred` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- used to determine compliance with a condition to abstain
#ASSERT `s 742.31(1) the use of a bodily substance provided under a conditional sentence order is barred` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(2) the use or disclosure of the results of the analysis of a bodily substance is barred` `s 742.31(3) disclosure to the offender to whom the results relate` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "Subject to subsection (3)"
#ASSERT `s 742.31(2) the use or disclosure of the results of the analysis of a bodily substance is barred` `s 742.31(3) use or disclosure in the course of proceedings under section 742.6` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(2) the use or disclosure of the results of the analysis of a bodily substance is barred` `s 742.31(3) use or disclosure, if the results are made anonymous, for statistical or other research purposes` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(2) the use or disclosure of the results of the analysis of a bodily substance is barred` `s 742.31(2) any other use or disclosure, or allowing the disclosure` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(3) the results of the analysis of a bodily substance may be used or disclosed` `s 742.31(3) disclosure to the offender to whom the results relate` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(3) the results of the analysis of a bodily substance may be used or disclosed` `s 742.31(3) use or disclosure in the course of proceedings under section 742.6` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(3) the results of the analysis of a bodily substance may be used or disclosed` `s 742.31(3) use or disclosure, if the results are made anonymous, for statistical or other research purposes` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(3) the results of the analysis of a bodily substance may be used or disclosed` `s 742.31(2) any other use or disclosure, or allowing the disclosure` EQUALS NOTHING   -- subsection (3) does not speak to other uses (subsection (2) bars them)
#ASSERT `s 742.31(4) the person is guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(4) the person is guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 742.31(4) the punishment`'s `mode` EQUALS `on summary conviction`
#ASSERT `s 742.31(4) the punishment`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `no imprisonment is stated`   -- the text states no maximum; section 787 is outside this range
